{"c":[{"id":"5e2a432b193b2a33","sum":"Repo setup and v1 lore: SumMem at .summem/summem; .scratch/ never committed; v1 kept five upstreams with Screenpipe as a sidecar plus last-N facade.","tree":{"c":[{"id":"13a625ab21eb3fe9","sum":"SumMem 0.12.0 lives at .summem/summem (AGENTS.md Project Memory block is the write rule); .scratch/ is gitignored local scratch, never committed.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260919T170845Z-b7aad83361017857","text":"Onboarded SumMem 0.12.0 as .summem/summem (not a packages/ pin); AGENTS.md Project Memory block is the write rule.","type":"note"},{"name":"20260919T172705Z-bea3983b0d18183c","text":".scratch/ is gitignored local scratch (exports, dumps); do not commit it","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"ab8c7585980a9874","sum":"v1 Caret keeps five upstreams (KeyType, GhostType, Computer Use Jev, Skyvern, Screenpipe); Screenpipe history is a sidecar plus last-N facade, never vendored, no TCC inherited from its CLI.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260919T173934Z-80f0ac884170d4c1","text":"Caret keeps five upstreams: KeyType, GhostType, Computer Use Jev, Skyvern and Screenpipe. docs/input-pipeline.md defines the proposed shared Jev/context/workflow handoff; the current action UI does not call the Python CLI.","type":"note"},{"name":"20260919T174647Z-c6a318f44bd68335","text":"Screenpipe history for Caret is sidecar plus facade (last N minutes/windows); do not vendor current engine or inherit TCC from their CLI","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"05674c45506c1bae","sum":"v1 Screenpipe and secrets: last-N inference hard-fails when the sidecar is down or empty; Caret supervises pinned Screenpipe via a launcher lease; Supabase is control plane only; never commit SUPABASE_HACKATHON_TOKEN.","tree":{"c":[{"id":"a7b8b39bcec29186","sum":"v1: inference needing Screenpipe last-N hard-fails when the sidecar is down or empty; CI has secret SUPABASE_HACKATHON_TOKEN, never commit its value.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260919T174733Z-8bbd21a4d3d18747","text":"Caret inference that needs Screenpipe history hard-fails if the sidecar is down or last-N is empty; do not continue on a miss","type":"note"},{"name":"20260919T175112Z-813e2fb0e5f124b2","text":"GitHub Actions repo secret SUPABASE_HACKATHON_TOKEN is available for CI; do not commit the value.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"0988f580d7d5ff22","sum":"v1: Caret launches and supervises pinned Screenpipe (TCC stays on its binary; client uses the launcher lease); Supabase only as control plane, never for last-N or threads.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260919T175326Z-cc8628073d6c6682","text":"Override: Caret launches and supervises pinned Screenpipe; do not spawn revoked; TCC still on their binary; client uses launcher lease","type":"note"},{"name":"20260919T175517Z-d3f766ae6d1e35f4","text":"Supabase earns a seat only as company control plane (identity, entitlements, kill-switch, structured facts); skill bodies stay git/Cursor plugins; never upload last-N or threads.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"}]}
